#
# Peak Streamflow-Qualification Codes(peak_cd):
#   1 ... Discharge is a Maximum Daily Average
#   2 ... Discharge is an Estimate
#   3 ... Discharge affected by Dam Failure
#   4 ... Discharge less than indicated value,
